  "disposition": [
    "The PR adds seven archival experiment workflows, two helper scripts and three preregistrations. None of these twelve paths exists at the same path on the frozen main. One guard preregistration blob is already present at an alternate main path. Preserve duplicate and missing inputs under an inactive evidence path, including five earlier executed controller versions.",
    "The 598f4ee scalar-select candidate is a separate non-ancestor branch off 55d897. Its cached statement helper, specialized KernelRepository.one path and candidate-specific regression do not occur on the frozen main. Preserve both external source blobs and the actual 600s probe; adoption as production behavior is a separate design decision. This code was never added by PR18.",
    "The later large-world witness subject and independent regression, HTTP50 subjects and native desktop subject are ancestors of the reviewed main. The main includes active benchmark and production-facing test entry points listed above. No missing production source was found in the twelve-file PR diff.",
    "A main evidence summary or a probe pass is not a new qualification of the current main. The 600-second pairs recorded NOT_EXECUTED for the original one-hour gate. The first guard files are also represented loosely on main; other raw artifacts are retained in their exact original ZIPs."
  ]
